What If a Black Hole Replaced Our Sun? — flat-vector explainer (1080×1920, 24 fps)
Everything on screen is drawn in code (main.js + kit.js, canvas 2D): Earth, the Sun, the black hole, the photons, the astronaut,
the fish, the giant star, the type. No images, no stock footage, no generated media. Our own character designs, in the
Beyond Everything brand style. Facts: the fact-check table in SCRIPT.md.

